+/*
+ * Android AAudio output for Shairport Sync.
+ *
+ * Plays through AAudio from the (root) Shairport process and reports the real output
+ * delay from AAudioStream_getTimestamp(), so Shairport's synchronisation works as with ALSA.
+ * libaaudio.so is loaded at run time: the binary still starts on API 25, where init() fails.
+ *
